# Barcode Quick Reference

| Format | Use Case | Size |
|--------|---------|------|
| QR_CODE | Receipt lookup, payment | 200x200px |
| CODE_128 | Internal SKU | 300x80px |
| EAN-13 | Retail products | 150x60px |

| Error Correction | Recovery |
|-----------------|----------|
| L (7%) | Low |
| M (15%) | Medium — recommended |
| Q (25%) | High |
| H (30%) | Highest |